course: dictionary
lesson: 10413
title: Trilobites: animals from long ago
level: primary-5
stars: 0
explain: A trilobite was a sea animal that lived a very, very long time ago, from about 520 to 250 million years ago. Trilobites are now extinct, which means no living ones are left. We only know them from fossils, the stone shapes left behind when an animal dies and is pressed into rock.
explain: The name tells you a clue: tri means three, and a trilobite's body had three lobes, a middle part and two sides. «Trilobites were sea creatures with jointed legs and hard shells» tells you what they looked like. Jointed legs bend at joints, like your knees and elbows.
explain: The words around a word give you clues. In «Trilobites were sea creatures with jointed legs and hard shells, distant cousins of crabs and insects», distant cousins means related, but not very close. So crabs and insects are relatives of trilobites in the animal family tree.
fact: A trilobite was a sea animal with a hard, jointed shell and many legs.
fact: Trilobites lived about 520 to 250 million years ago.
fact: «Extinct» means no longer alive anywhere on Earth.
fact: A trilobite fossil is the remains or shape of a trilobite, pressed into rock.
fact: Each kind of trilobite lived at a certain time, so trilobite fossils help scientists date rock layers.
exercise: What is a trilobite? | A kind of dinosaur that could fly | A bird that lived in trees | A plant that grew on rocks | *A sea animal with a hard, jointed shell and many legs
exercise: «Trilobites are now extinct.» What does extinct mean? | *No longer alive anywhere | Still swimming in the sea today | Very large and heavy | Found only in one small town
exercise: Why do scientists study trilobite fossils to learn about rock layers? | Trilobites are found in every kind of rock | Fossils make rocks softer | Trilobites can be seen in the sky | *Each kind lived at a certain time, so the fossils help date the rock
test: «Trilobites were distant cousins of crabs and insects.» What does distant cousins mean here? | Enemies that hunt each other | Animals that look exactly the same | *Related animals, though not very closely | Close family who live in the same house
test: A trilobite fossil is the same as what? | A living trilobite in the sea | A rock with no animal in it at all | A shell from a modern crab | *A stone shape left behind by a trilobite
exam: «Trilobites lived for about 270 million years and had some of the first complex eyes, made of crystal.» Find and copy one word that means very old. | fossil | *ancient | jointed | distant
